<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Kasei - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Kasei - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.80		vs	    9.52</p>
<p> Operating	  151    million	  vs	  354    million</p>
<p> Current	    222    million	  vs	  421    million</p>
<p> Net		  110    million	  vs	  193    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.45 yen	  vs	    4.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     45 million	  vs	  45 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawasaki Kasei Chemical Ltd is a maker of organic acid products and derivatives.</p>
